  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p class="dek">Write to the desk about the site. Write to the seller about an order.</p>
  <p><strong>Company:</strong> Etern Digital</p>
  <p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://dailyinsightdesk.com/">dailyinsightdesk.com</a></p>
  <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:edproservice@gmail.com">edproservice@gmail.com</a></p>
  <h2>How we can help</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Questions about the guides and the site.</li>
    <li>Affiliate and business inquiries.</li>
    <li>Corrections to something we published.</li>
    <li>Copyright or privacy requests.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We try to answer legitimate notes within 48 to 72 business hours.</p>
  <h2>Orders, shipping, and refunds</h2>
  <p>Daily Insight Desk does not sell the products mentioned in the guides. We do not take payment, ship packages, or keep a store’s order records. If a purchase is late, damaged, or not what the seller described, contact that seller. We cannot look up the transaction or issue the refund.</p>
  <h2>Privacy of your email</h2>
  <p>If you email us, we use that address to reply. Please do not send passwords, full payment card numbers, or other sensitive financial information.</p>
